{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Messages｜结构图\n主路径已构建；旧12回归与LateCreate两例通过，E8其余边界仍开放。[[Messages/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Messages.canvas|发布流程]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1530,
      "height": 125,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "source",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOHealthSet\nPre/PostGameplayEffectExecute：结算。\nPostAttributeChange：数值/边沿。\nBegin/EndRepNotifyFrame：建帧/清帧。\nCanClassifyRepNotifyFrame：校验来源/注册。\nOnAttributeAggregatorCreated：迟到创建。\n帧仅存活于宏；GAS拥有聚合器。\n[[Messages/结构#HealthSet 的复制调用作用域|复制契约]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|GAS结构]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "payload",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOVerbMessage\nVerb → 通道；Instigator → 真实 EffectCauser（可空）；Target → ASC 宿主。Tags → 捕获快照；Magnitude → Damage/meta 原幅度，直接 Poise GE 为实际损失。",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "router",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGameplayMessageSubsystem\nBroadcastMessage(Verb, Message)：当前 GameInstance 内同步派发；不保存 GAS 状态，不提供网络传输。",
      "x": 1090,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "readers",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UI / 音频 / 统计（目标）\nRegisterListener(Verb)：只读消费；生命周期结束时 Unregister。C++ 未发现消费者，蓝图资产与动态接线待验证。",
      "x": 1090,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "event",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GameplayEvent 与逻辑委托\nHealthSet 的死亡/破韧委托 → HealthComponent/能力链；HandleGameplayEvent 发往指定 ASC，保留 GA 生命周期。GameplayMessage 不请求能力。",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 发布/订阅与复制边界\nPoiseBreak仅真实正值到零；meta消费、Clamp、锁存提交后发布对应Modifier快照。消息观察者只读。\nRepNotify帧仅有调用局部阶段：未判定 / 等待最终引擎写入 / 后续真实变化；不持有聚合器。弱Outer/ASC或注册失配只停用本次分类，不取消复制历史。\n宏Scope先清帧再发incoming/有效复制快照；复制不重建GameplayMessage，也不覆盖重入后的实时锁存。\n已验证：旧12回归；LateCreate Health/Poise无初始聚合器、native内Infinite +5、宏后移除，两次归零及Poise真实Break幅度5。\n仍未全面验：已有聚合器新持续GE、嵌套OnRep、重登记/迁移、meta与网络/批处理/预测；E8开放，消费者接线待验。详见[[Messages/结构|契约与证明范围]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
